3. **MCP tools check existing** - `discover_existing_capabilities()` prevents duplicates
4. **Workflow folders** - organize modules by domain (auth/, catalog/, etc.)
5. **SRP for Role methods** - ONE business goal per method (navigation is prerequisite)

